content:
Priya: Heads-up: onboarding for NeonCart triggered a warmup storm. Their SPA + service-worker both call our preflight on load and visibilitychange → lots of 429s in the first 10 minutes. Can someone assist?
Sam: common pattern. Can you paste their preflight flow?
Priya: simplified: router fires preflight on route change, and SW fetch handler also calls preflight for background sync. They also refresh ephemeral tokens every 30s.
Customer-Eng: we patched quickly to repro: multiple tabs cause parallel token refreshes and ~6 preflight calls per tab on cold start.
Luis: immediate advice: 1) client side - memoize token requests so only one inflight per tab, 2) debounce SW preflight using clients.matchAll() to check for active tab, 3) add x-client-id header so edge groups requests.
Sam: snippet to coalesce token requests:
```js
let inflight=null;
async function getEphemeral(){
  if (inflight) return inflight;
  inflight = fetch('/auth/ephemeral').finally(()=> setTimeout(()=> inflight=null,30000));
  const r = await inflight; return r;
}
```
Priya: asked them to add `x-client-id: neoncart-web-1` and to avoid refresh on every visibilitychange.
OnboardBot: created ticket #NEON-WARM-04 for 36h temp warmup capacity, owner: Luis, ETA: 90m.
Customer-Eng: after the client patch + header we saw grouping and 429s dropped significantly. Logs: [2026-03-10T11:40:02Z] preflight neoncart-web-1 200; [2026-03-10T11:40:19Z] preflight neoncart-web-1 429; [2026-03-10T11:40:45Z] preflight neoncart-web-1 200 retry.
Luis: CS handoff checklist — ["deploy token coalesce","debounce SW preflight","set x-client-id","ops temp bump NEON-WARM-04","monitor 2h and rollback plan"]. Offer small SDK helper to make coalescing opt-in.
Priya: sending checklist to customer and scheduling a 1:1 to confirm. Closing once 2h stable. :thumbsup:
